// A RACK instrument: a note -> audio sampler (type: "rack"), not a plugin. This module is the
// sampler and nothing more: the sounds — each a TAP, a MIDI note and the sample it fires — are
// written on the NODE that uses it (see rack-demo.k7/nodes/kit.k7x), so every node of this
// module can be a different kit. Samples live in a library's samples/ or a project's own.
type("rack")
